            "action_name": {
              "value": "Project Terror"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, enchantment, fear, mental, occult)\n\nThe rhu-chalik creates nightmarish visions in the target's mind. The target must attempt a DC 24 Will save.\n\nCritical Success: The target creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to Project Terror for 1 minute.\nSuccess: The target is unaffected.\nFailure: The target becomes frightened 2. Failing additional saves against this effect increases the frightened condition value by 2; if this would increase the target's frightened value beyond frightened 4, the target is fleeing for 1 round and frightened 4.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but the target becomes unconscious for 30 minutes instead of fleeing."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
